OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fat first this evening, but cloud
OL,7,Famounts tend to increase through the
OL,8,Fnight with perhaps some light rain or
OL,9,Fdrizzle in the south by dawn. Chilly.
OL,10,FLight winds but breezy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA bright start in the north,
OL,13,Fhowever cloudier across the south with
OL,14,Fspells of light rain or drizzle which
OL,15,Fwill move north to reach all parts by
OL,16,Fthe afternoon. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
